OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested over fireworks
OL,4,Adirected at people
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree males aged between 17 and 20 have
OL,7,Fbeen arrested on suspicion of setting
OL,8,Ffireworks off in the direction of
OL,9,Fpeople.
OL,11,FCumbria Police said it authorised a
OL,12,Fdispersal order on Monday evening,
OL,13,Fafter reports of "youths congregating
OL,14,Fand setting off fireworks" at Chances
OL,15,FPark, Wigton Road, Dunmail Drive,
OL,16,FDalston Road and Peter Lane in
OL,17,FCarlisle.
OL,19,FIn a statement on social media, the
OL,20,Fforce called on parents of teenagers to
OL,21,Fhave a "real conversation" on the
OL,22,Fdangers of fireworks.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
